---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { links } from "../data/links";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Whitzard & Nuwa"
  description="Learn about Whitzard, Nuwa Frontier AI Safety Lab, their Eastern-rooted naming, research roots, and core team."
  ogImage="/assets/og/whitzard-og.png"
>
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-6">

      <!-- Mission -->
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-wz-ink font-semibold tracking-tight mb-5" style="font-size: var(--text-h1);">
          About Whitzard and Nuwa
        </h1>
        <p class="text-wz-body text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Whitzard builds generalized, intelligent safety modules for frontier AI and agentic systems, designed for real-world vertical scenarios and public safety. Nuwa Frontier AI Safety Lab is the research lab supported by Whitzard, focused on transparent, third-party, open evaluation and governance evidence for frontier AI safety.
        </p>
        <p class="text-wz-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
          Together, Whitzard and Nuwa represent two complementary layers: Whitzard builds deployable safety infrastructure; Nuwa develops transparent research, open evaluation frameworks, and governance evidence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Names and Eastern Roots -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <SectionHeader title="Names and Eastern Roots" subtitle="The mythology behind Whitzard and Nuwa." />

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-wz-panel-blue/30 border border-wz-hairline rounded-xl p-7">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <img src="/assets/logo/whitzard_logo.png" alt="" class="w-8 h-8 rounded" />
              <div>
                <p class="text-wz-ink font-semibold text-lg">Whitzard</p>
                <p class="text-wz-muted font-normal text-sm">白泽 Baize</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-wz-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
              In Chinese mythology, Baize is a wise creature known for recognizing hidden threats and understanding the forms of unseen dangers. The name Whitzard carries this idea into AI safety: detect hidden risks, understand complex systems, and protect society before harm occurs.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-nw-jade-pale/40 border border-nw-hairline rounded-xl p-7">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <img src="/assets/logo/nvwa_logo.png" alt="" class="w-8 h-8 rounded" />
              <div>
                <p class="text-nw-ink font-semibold text-lg">Nuwa</p>
                <p class="text-nw-muted font-normal text-sm">女娲 Nüwa</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-nw-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Nüwa is known for repairing the sky. For Nuwa Frontier AI Safety Lab, this metaphor points to a research mission: identify safety gaps in advanced AI systems, repair fragile boundaries, and build evidence for controllable AI before failures become systemic.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Organization Relationship -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <SectionHeader title="Organization" subtitle="How Whitzard and Nuwa work together." />

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-wz-panel-blue/40 border border-wz-hairline rounded-xl p-7">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
              <img src="/assets/logo/whitzard_logo.png" alt="" class="w-6 h-6 rounded" />
              <span class="text-wz-ink font-semibold text-base">Whitzard</span>
              <span class="text-wz-muted font-normal text-sm">白泽</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-wz-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-wz-blue mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Company and product brand</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-wz-blue mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Generalized intelligent safety modules</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-wz-blue mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Evaluation, runtime defense, monitoring systems</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-wz-blue mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Real vertical-domain safety solutions</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-wz-blue mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Public safety orientation</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-nw-jade-pale/40 border border-nw-hairline rounded-xl p-7">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
              <img src="/assets/logo/nvwa_logo.png" alt="" class="w-6 h-6 rounded" />
              <span class="text-nw-jade text-sm">&#9670;</span>
              <span class="text-nw-ink font-semibold text-base">Nuwa</span>
              <span class="text-nw-muted font-normal text-sm">女娲</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-nw-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-nw-jade mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Research lab supported by Whitzard</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-nw-jade mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Transparent third-party evaluation</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-nw-jade mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Open infrastructure and benchmarks</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-nw-jade mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Frontier AI safety evaluation and governance</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-nw-jade mt-0.5 text-xs">&#9670;</span>
                <span>Research on autonomy risks, deception, scheming, and loss-of-control</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-2xl mt-6">
          <p class="text-wz-body text-base leading-relaxed">
            Nuwa develops the research agenda, evaluation methodology, benchmarks, and governance evidence. Whitzard builds the deployable safety infrastructure that brings these ideas into real systems and public safety scenarios.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- The Triangle Team -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <SectionHeader title="The Triangle Team" subtitle="Core members driving Whitzard and Nuwa." />

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- Dr. Jiarun Dai -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-wz-hairline rounded-xl p-6 md:p-7">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-4">
              <div class="flex-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                  <p class="text-wz-ink font-semibold text-base">Dr. Jiarun Dai</p>
                  <span class="text-wz-blue text-xs font-medium bg-wz-panel-blue/40 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">CEO</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-wz-body text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
                  Dr. Jiarun Dai is the CEO of Whitzard and an Assistant Professor at <a href={links.fudanUniversity} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">Fudan University</a>. He is a cybersecurity expert and former captain of the Fudan Baize CTF team, with deep experience in binary analysis, vulnerability discovery, and exploitation. He received both his Ph.D. and B.Sc. from <a href={links.fudanUniversity} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">Fudan University</a> under the supervision of <a href={links.minYang} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">Prof. Min Yang</a>, at the <a href={links.fudanSecurityLab} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">System Software and Security Lab</a> where Prof. Min Yang is the leading professor.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:flex-col md:items-end">
                <a href="https://djrrr.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue text-xs hover:underline no-underline whitespace-nowrap">Homepage &rarr;</a>
                <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=YH1Y454AAAAJ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue text-xs hover:underline no-underline whitespace-nowrap">Google Scholar &rarr;</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Dr. Xudong Pan -->
          <div class="bg-white border border-wz-hairline rounded-xl p-6 md:p-7">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-4">
              <div class="flex-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                  <p class="text-wz-ink font-semibold text-base">Dr. Xudong Pan</p>
                  <span class="text-wz-blue text-xs font-medium bg-wz-panel-blue/40 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">CTO</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-wz-body text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
                  Dr. Xudong Pan is the CTO of Whitzard and an Assistant Professor (Xuemin Fellow) at <a href={links.fudanUniversity} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">Fudan University</a>, as well as a PhD Advisor at the Shanghai Innovation Institute. His work focuses on AI safety, model safety, AI system security, and frontier AI risk evaluation. He received both his Ph.D. and B.Sc. from <a href={links.fudanUniversity} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">Fudan University</a> under the supervision of <a href={links.minYang} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">Prof. Min Yang</a>, at the <a href={links.fudanSecurityLab} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">System Software and Security Lab</a> where Prof. Min Yang is the leading professor.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:flex-col md:items-end">
                <a href="https://ravensanstete.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue text-xs hover:underline no-underline whitespace-nowrap">Homepage &rarr;</a>
                <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=Unl69CYAAAAJ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue text-xs hover:underline no-underline whitespace-nowrap">Google Scholar &rarr;</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/ravenSanstete" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue text-xs hover:underline no-underline whitespace-nowrap">GitHub &rarr;</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Dr. Geng Hong -->
          <div class="bg-wz-panel border border-wz-hairline rounded-xl p-6 md:p-7">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-4">
              <div class="flex-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                  <p class="text-wz-ink font-semibold text-base">Dr. Geng Hong</p>
                  <span class="text-wz-teal text-xs font-medium bg-wz-teal-soft px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">Strategic Bridge / Research Partner</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-wz-body text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
                  Dr. Geng Hong is an Assistant Professor at <a href={links.fudanUniversity} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">Fudan University</a> and a strategic bridge and research partner for Whitzard and Nuwa. His work spans cybercrime, penetration testing, cybersecurity ecosystem research, and in-the-wild security studies, bringing practical security insight into AI safety evaluation and governance.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:flex-col md:items-end">
                <a href={links.gengHong} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue text-xs hover:underline no-underline whitespace-nowrap">Homepage &rarr;</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Research Roots -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <SectionHeader title="Research Roots" subtitle="Our academic and research foundations." />
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <p class="text-wz-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Our core team has research roots in the <a href={links.fudanSecurityLab} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">System Software and Security Lab</a> at <a href={links.fudanUniversity} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">Fudan University</a>, where <a href={links.minYang} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-wz-blue hover:underline">Prof. Min Yang</a> is the leading professor. This foundation in system security, vulnerability research, and AI safety continues to shape our approach to building practical safety infrastructure for frontier AI systems.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Research and Collaboration -->
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
        <SectionHeader title="Research and Collaboration" />
        <p class="text-wz-body text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Nuwa's research work is grounded in frontier AI risk evaluation, agent safety, AI control, and AI system security. We use this site to maintain a public record of research outputs, technical notes, and collaboration directions.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/research" class="inline-flex items-center bg-wz-ink text-white rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-wz-navy transition-colors no-underline">
            View Research
          </a>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center bg-white text-wz-ink border border-wz-hairline rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-wz-border-strong transition-colors no-underline">
            Collaborate With Us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
